.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH pepe-html 1  pepe "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pepe\-html \- Turn a run\*(Aqs or a ramp\*(Aqs JSON report into a page: one self\-contained HTML file
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpepe html\fR [\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-out\fR] [\fB\-\-open\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIREPORT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Turn a run\*(Aqs or a ramp\*(Aqs JSON report into a page: one self\-contained HTML file
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-out\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Where the page goes; beside the report, as .html, by default
.TP
\fB\-\-open\fR
Open it in the browser once written
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIREPORT\fR>
The JSON report: a run\*(Aqs (\-\-json, \-\-snapshot, a recorded run) or a ramp\*(Aqs
